OL,5,G1300 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FFor the final visit the B&Bers go
OL,7,     Fglamping again, at Phil and Jane's
OL,8,     Fsite in Derbyshire, where the
OL,9,     Fstag-gering views include
OL,10,     Freal-life deer wandering about the
OL,11,     Fplace.
OL,12,G1330 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FOn payment day, the B&Bers clash
OL,14,     Fover furniture failings and clock
OL,15,     Fcomplaints. And sparks fly -
OL,16,     Fironically - over a lack of
OL,17,     Felectricity. But who's won?
